- entry .place   copies a frozen array into a mutable `scala.Array` at a position
-     `target.place(source, ordinal)` is `System.arraycopy` from a frozen array into a mutable
-     one, starting at `ordinal` (`Prim` by default). The confined form for a `Scribe` is
-     `Scribe#place`.
